IANOS:Antiparkinsonianos are medications that can inhibit gastric motility.", "INTERACCIÓN FARMACODINÁMICA:Interacción farmacodinámica occurs when there are alterations in the pharmacological action of a drug or the nutritional properties of a preparation without changes in pharmacokinetics.", "ADMINISTRACIÓN CONJUNTA:Administración conjunta refers to the simultaneous administration of drugs and enteral nutrition, which can lead to interactions affecting drug efficacy.", "PREVENCIÓN DE INTERACCIONES:Prevención de interacciones involves recommendations for administering medications to minimize interactions with enteral nutrition.", "FORMAS FARMACÉUTICAS:Formas farmacéuticas refer to the various pharmaceutical forms of medications that can affect their absorption and efficacy when administered with enteral nutrition.", "CUBIERTA ENTERICA:Cubierta entérica is a type of pharmaceutical form designed to protect the active ingredient from degradation in the stomach.", "LIBERACIÓN RETARDADA:Liberación retardada refers to pharmaceutical forms that release the active ingredient slowly over time, which can be affected by crushing the medication.", "ABSORCIÓN SUBLINGUAL:Absorción sublingual refers to the absorption of medications directly into the bloodstream through the tissues under the tongue, which can be altered by enteral nutrition.", "COMPRIMIDOS EFERVESCENTES:Comprimidos efervescentes are effervescent tablets that can be affected by the administration route and formulation when given with enteral nutrition."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}